0:53Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "11. David Lean, the master of the epic, spent his final years obsessed with a book by Simon Sebag Montefiore. He wanted to move away from the desert and the jungle of Lawrence of Arabia to the cold, paranoid corridors of power, depicting the internal power struggles and the fear-inducing regime that shaped the 20th century. The project died with Lean in 1991. Whose brutal reign was to be the focus of Lean's final cinematic statement?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:31:09Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Stalin?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:31:09Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "franco", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:31:10Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Stalin", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:31:11Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "spain", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:31:24Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Joseph Stalin is correct", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:31:29Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "I have read montefiore’s book!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:31:42Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Pavan 50 Sal 30 Vats 20 Akshay 10", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:32:05Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "last of the set:", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:32:26Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "12. In 1937, producer Alexander Korda and director Josef von Sternberg began filming a lavish adaptation of a Roman autobiography. The production was a nightmare: lead actor Charles Laughton suffered a nervous breakdown, and the leading lady was injured in a car crash, leading the studio to claim insurance and shut it down forever. The existing footage shows a terrifyingly brilliant performance of a stuttering, limping man who unexpectedly becomes the most powerful person on Earth. Which Roman Emperor’s life was being chronicled?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:32:36Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Spartacus", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:32:36Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "caesar", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T14:32:38Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Aurelius", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]